          <h1 class="hero__name" data-reveal><span class="hero__line">Nick</span> <span class="hero__line">Salazar</span></h1>
          <p class="hero__role" data-reveal>Independent marine surveyor &amp; cargo consultant</p>
          <p class="hero__lede" data-reveal>About ten years surveying cargo. When something is lifted, stowed, moved or claimed, someone has to see it and write down what happened. That is the job.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline hero__cta" href="#contact" data-reveal>Build a brief</a>
